SUMMARY:Czech Republic: EU Pay Transparency Directive - phased Labour Code 
 amendment (draft)
DESCRIPTION:Draft — not yet law\, 1 Jan 2027 (Mostly from 1 Jan 2027). Th
 e draft amendment to the Labour Code\, published on 27 March 2026\, transp
 osing the directive foresees phased entry into force: most provisions are 
 expected to take effect from 1 January 2027\, while regular pay-gap report
 ing\, the related pay assessment and corrective measures\, and employees' 
 right to request written pay information are expected from 1 January 2028.
